      "cooked": "<p>I’m creating some new characters using the editable character sheet PDF found here: <a href=\"https://forum.greaterthangames.com/content/sentinel-comics-the-roleplaying-game-form-fillable-hero-sheet\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://forum.greaterthangames.com/content/sentinel-comics-the-roleplaying-game-form-fillable-hero-sheet</a>. If I click on the link and open it without downloading it, there are no issues in using it. Once I download it to my laptop, however, I can only enter a single line of text in each “Game Text” field on the sheet.</p>\n<p>Any idea what the issue could be? I’m running Windows 11, if that’s helpful.</p>",
